.DS_Store

# The driver, built in place by `go build -o vcc.exe ./cmd/vcc` and by the
# test runner. Windows names it .exe; every other host does not.
vcc
vcc.exe

# Go leaves the previous binary beside the new one when it cannot replace a
# running executable, which is every rebuild while a vcc process is alive.
vcc.exe~
vccstats.exe
vccstats.exe~

# A throwaway main built beside the compiler to profile it.
.prof/

*.exe